  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nThis is a cinematic recipe intended for outdoor use, such as under cloudy skies or in forests. It adds a hint of blue to dark areas, making the greens of forests and trees stand out. It is also intended for use in portraits, so the colors of human skin and other areas are well preserved. This recipe gives a completely different impression depending on the brightness of the video or photo, so it is a good idea to change the exposure while shooting to find the atmosphere you prefer.",
